Error [E0398]: This arithmetic spelling is retired; use `bit_and`
  --> tests/ui/sigil_arithmetic_retired.jet:2:13
    |
  2 |     print(1 & 2)
    |             ^
 Why: Marks express ownership and outcomes; arithmetic uses named methods (D-SIGIL-ALGEBRA1=B)
 Fix: Write `value.bit_and(other)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0398

